    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d693">

                <pb facs="0806" n="688" xml:id="pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.60 f 12A/7: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Einstein</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Prague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-11T11:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 11,
                                1928—11 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 11:25
                    a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>54. Your 28, June 28 [<hi rendition="#italic">27</hi>], 5 p.m. Minister for
                    Foreign Affairs tells me that he is instructing Czechoslovak Minister in
                    Washington to sign arbitration treaty in the form desired by you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Einstein</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
